<title>INDONESIA: Bank Bali 1996 net up to 131.98 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Bank Bali 1996 net up to 131.98 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>				(in billions of rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit					   131.98 vs 96.09</p>
<p>    Fully diluted earnings per share (rupiah)  490    vs 423</p>
<p>    Net interest income			     332.25  vs 261.81</p>
<p>    Other operating income			  121.38  vs  96.30</p>
<p>    Other operating expense			 289.20  vs 240.11</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit				    179.38  vs 130.09</p>
<p>    Retained earnings				 271.12  vs 195.54</p>
<p>NOTE: The consolidated results were audited. PT Bank Bali is one of the largest privately run banks in Indonesia.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom 6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
